Which extension does each 'context.pop()' resolve to?
ContextExtensions.pop is only reachable from a file that imports
shared/extensions/context_extensions.dart. Files that do, pre-change:
$ git grep -ln 'shared/extensions/context_extensions.dart' 4a5f8f2 -- lib test examples integration_test tool bricks
4a5f8f2:test/shared/extensions/context_extensions_test.dart

No file under lib/ imports it, so NO production 'context.pop()' could have
resolved to ContextExtensions.pop. task_detail_screen.dart imports only
package:go_router, so its context.pop() is GoRouterHelper.pop:
