VERDICT

Note first: the many `navigateToHome()` / `navigateToLogin()` hits above are a
different symbol. They are placeholder function names inside prose snippets
(`success: (user) => navigateToHome()`), not calls to `ContextExtensions`. The
substring match picks them up; they are not consumers and are excluded below.

